{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-frame-value","title":"prop:volume-form-frame-value","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1478,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:volume-form-frame-value","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:volume-form-pointwise]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:frame-matrix]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:volume-form-gram-determinant]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:volume-form-frame-value","line":2498,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[The Value of $dV_g$ on an Oriented Frame]\n\\label{prop:volume-form-frame-value}\n\n\\uses{def:volume-form-pointwise, def:frame-matrix, lem:volume-form-gram-determinant}\n\n\n\n\nIf $(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_n)$ is positively oriented at $x$, then\n\\[\ndV_g|_x(Y_1|_x,\\ldots,Y_n|_x)=\\sqrt{\\det(g_{ij}(x))}.\n\\]\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:volume-form-gram-determinant,def:frame-matrix}\n\\sketch Apply Lemma \\ref{lem:volume-form-gram-determinant} to the basis $(Y_i|_x)$; its Gram matrix is $(g_{ij}(x))$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[The Value of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dV_g$\">$dV_g$</span> on an Oriented Frame] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a766f6c756d652d666f726d2d6672616d652d76616c7565\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Avolume-form-pointwise\">↗ def:volume-form-pointwise</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fbluepri